		)
		(uuid "79b61e14-fc76-4515-b0d5-9992aa7ba3b8")
	)
	(text "1. Each pixel: U1 WS2814C (4-channel constant-current driver, ~16.5 mA per channel) drives the cathodes of D1 QBLP679-RGBCW (R, G, B, cool white); the anodes go to +5V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 87.376 225.552 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 60 68 74 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8a8240ed-c6b4-4728-9867-3ee995909946")
	)
	(text "2. R1 100 R + C1 100 nF filter the VDD of each WS2814C (supply range 3.7 V to 5.3 V)."
